WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Praise be to God. We praise Him, seek His help, and ask for His forgiveness.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
We seek refuge in God from the evil of our souls and from our bad deeds.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Whomsoever God guides, none can misguide, and whomsoever He misguides, none can guide.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
I bear witness that there is no god but God alone, with no partner.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
And I bear witness that Muhammad is His servant and Messenger.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
O you who believe, fear God as He should be feared,

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
and do not die except in a state of Islam.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
O you who believe, fear your Lord who created you from a single soul,

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
and created from it its mate, and spread from them many men and women.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Fear God and speak words of truth.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.000
He will correct your deeds and forgive your sins.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Whoever obeys God and His Messenger has achieved a great success.